# Media files — keep directory structure, ignore actual binaries
# In development we track the .gitkeep files to preserve the dir structure.
# Uncomment the lines below if you want to exclude audio/image from version control:
# media/audio/*.mp3
# media/audio/*.wav
# media/albums/*.webp
# media/albums/*.jpg
# media/albums/*.png
# media/artists/*.webp
